{% comment %}
  These style the zoomed photo. medium-zoom adds its classes at runtime from a CDN script, so purgecss
  cannot see them in the site's files; an inline style is out of its reach.
  The z-index puts the photo above the fixed navbar, and the solid background hides what is behind it.
  Reduced motion keeps a tiny duration: medium-zoom waits for transitionend, which never fires at zero.
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  .medium-zoom-overlay,
  .medium-zoom-image--opened {
    z-index: 1040;
  }

  .medium-zoom-overlay {
    background: var(--global-bg-color) !important;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    img.medium-zoom-image {
      transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    }
  }
</style>

{% assign fragments = site.data.fragments %}
<section class="elsewhere-section fragments" id="fragments">
  <h2>Fragments</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">{{ fragments.intro }}</p>

  {%
    include fragment.liquid photo=fragments.photos.first number=1 loading="eager" class="fragment-hero"
    sizes="(min-width: 960px) 900px, calc(100vw - 30px)"
  %}

  <div class="fragments-columns">
    {% comment %}
      Each photo goes to the shorter column, so the columns stay level with no script and the
      numbers stay in reading order. The left column is wider: _design.scss splits the space beside
      the gap 61:39. Heights here are in the two columns' combined width (868px on a wide screen):
      the photo's own proportion times its column's share, plus its caption and gap (58px, 0.067).
      The right column starts lower (7rem, 112px, 0.129). Change the shares and the head start in
      both files together.
    {% endcomment %}
    {% assign left = 0.0 %}
    {% assign right = 0.129 %}
    {% for photo in fragments.photos offset: 1 %}
      {% assign image = site.data.fragment_images[photo.id].large %}
      {% assign shape = image.height | times: 1.0 | divided_by: image.width %}
      {% assign number = forloop.index | plus: 1 %}
      {% if left <= right %}
        {% assign side = 'fragment-left' %}
        {% assign left = shape | times: 0.61 | plus: 0.067 | plus: left %}
        {% assign sizes = '(min-width: 960px) 529px, (min-width: 768px) calc(61vw - 38px), calc(100vw - 30px)' %}
      {% else %}
        {% assign side = 'fragment-right' %}
        {% assign right = shape | times: 0.39 | plus: 0.067 | plus: right %}
        {% assign sizes = '(min-width: 960px) 339px, (min-width: 768px) calc(39vw - 24px), calc(100vw - 30px)' %}
      {% endif %}
      {% include fragment.liquid photo=photo number=number loading="lazy" class=side sizes=sizes %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
